OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FThis week Soweto's guest is
OL,7,     Finternationally celebrated
OL,8,     FAmerican saxophonist Immanuel
OL,9,     FWilkins. From Monday to Thursday,
OL,10,     Fhe shares some of the jazz albums
OL,11,     Fthat inspire him for 4/4.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FShostakovich's First Violin
OL,14,     FConcerto, Sibelius's Second
OL,15,     FSymphony and the tone poem
OL,16,     F'Pohjola's Daughter' from the WDR
OL,17,     FSymphony Orchestra in Cologne.
